Description: FlickOS developer kit: Node.js and npm
 Node.js and npm from Debian. Debian 13 has Node 20, which the Node
 project no longer supports; Debian still patches it. npm brings a few
 hundred small Debian packages with it.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Developer Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md).
